# Keep the build context lean and reproducible: never copy host build output or
# caches into the image. The web stage builds the SPA fresh (npm ci + npm run
# build) and the runtime pulls dist from that stage, so none of these are needed
# from the host — and copying a host node_modules/.venv in would bloat the image
# and risk shipping stale or platform-mismatched artifacts.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
run/
*.log
.DS_Store
